    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>unsigned enums</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>signed and unsigned integer</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>bool</computeroutput> Internally though we only manipulate integer with well defined and consistent semantics, this excludes typed enums and <computeroutput>bool</computeroutput> that are replaced with their unsigned counterparts. The correct type is restored in the public API. </para>
